Package: jarvis-voice-models
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: Speech models for the Jarvis assistant
 Whisper speech-recognition models (base and small) and Piper voices, all
 under redistributable licenses listed in
 /usr/share/doc/jarvis-voice-models/MODELS. No wake-word model is included.
